1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,700
Attention, all maintenance staff.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,480
Please listen carefully to the following important announcement.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:10,545
As you know, today is the day of the special meeting for all maintenance and engineering staff.

4
00:00:11,015 --> 00:00:20,640
The meeting will be held at the advertised time of 10:00 a.m. However, there has been a change of venue due to the damage to Building 5 caused by last night's storm.

5
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,480
The meeting will now be held in the cafeteria.

6
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:30,340
I repeat, today's meeting will not be held in the Building 5 conference room but has been moved to the cafeteria.

7
00:00:31,475 --> 00:00:34,380
That should please many of you because coffee will be available!

8
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:41,860
The meeting time will, however, be shortened in order to allow the repair teams to continue working on the Building 5 roof.

9
00:00:42,545 --> 00:00:42,800
Thanks.
